the extraordinary part.

01:21:26.140 --> 01:21:28.683
That is the crazy part!

01:21:32.860 --> 01:21:34.673
Sure I got a rec for ya, man.

01:21:36.730 --> 01:21:39.530
Man, I feel like this is gonna be,

01:21:39.530 --> 01:21:41.453
this is a music recommendation.

01:21:42.520 --> 01:21:46.920
Dang, this is gonna be,
it's gonna be polarizing.

01:21:46.920 --> 01:21:47.753
Uh-oh.

