01:22:32.759 --> 01:22:36.537
But the song Aja, A-J-A,

01:22:37.800 --> 01:22:39.870
that's a wild ride, man.

01:22:39.870 --> 01:22:41.620
And that's also the name of the album?

01:22:41.620 --> 01:22:43.180
Yeah.

01:22:43.180 --> 01:22:44.650
Crazy album.

